{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「AORUS」攤位報導！與Atata氏的「快打6」對戰會以及「FF7」「龍族教義 2」的試玩也有</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ffe184d7c83f42037179f7e1855c08d6dac9165fd5a1d4cbbb73e8aede947cf5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F14d8d30ff11ae273bf54d9cbd6e1b3d2.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日(四)～20日(日)舉辦的遊戲祭典「 東京電玩展2026 (以下稱TGS2026)」 這次為您送上「GIGABYTE(技嘉)」旗下電競品牌「 AORUS 」攤位的報導！</p><h3>報導試玩與對戰會盛況空前的「AORUS」攤位！</h3><p>「AORUS」攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c8f1fda679cb6d30e5187db7b86eeeba6c0782f757ab74d712c6d6a793a435a2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7f812249c163239ea791e3f2a740e969.jpg\"/><p>來到不愧是電競品牌、閃耀發光的「AORUS」攤位！</p><p>主機板一字排開</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0d04693282ce8b506699be79f5b79ee9fc48241373b51773d1ca25b27f157630/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8f63590fc950367476adfb85ff666356.jpg\"/><p>展示了GIGABYTE創業40週年紀念款「X870 AORUS INFINITY」等眾多主機板。</p><p>注目作品試玩區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a32e16845f884ffedaf12d6b5288408c477a8d1a50721c5ccba0292b6b281b3b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbb58ac96c54d16dacb2e0e1eb49d439e.jpg\"/><p>也有「鬼武者 Way of the Sword」「Final Fantasy VII 啟示錄」「Final Fantasy Resonance」等試玩！</p><p>由於可用最新電競PC遊玩，吸引了許多人聚集。</p><p>「快打6」客製PC</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f950db474a05518f0fdfe26ad1fe3ec664fead29f9b54cfdf58134c71d9e3d12/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffb9383dfa38ea93ed118f6cb062d19de.jpg\"/><p>「快打旋風6(以下稱快打6)」規格的 客製PC 登場。</p><p>春麗正在遊玩快打6！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/90fb0d5b5dcdfd484de17c7e9a56c51272ab6e80476246a5bdf574b31b14fe0d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F01cd7e475c16a143015a97b93d450415.jpg\"/><p>這裡舉辦了與扮成春麗的實況主兼角色扮演者 Atata ( @atata_dayo )氏的 「快打6」對戰活動 ！</p><p>與來場者對戰！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f41b6fcb39daf23c9cac7248b304746ada19358737199d372a681ebcb85c2f21/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2f09892d3b76d8134a55d8d7a18897a2.jpg\"/><p>與來場者展開了熱烈戰鬥。</p><p>認真勝負！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2ed7a66c4c137370404ba118fb71a45c40afe4be574a103e9f8d792e6bd2cf69/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6839d03a7e7673d9ae589b0d279cb9cd.jpg\"/><p>認真的眼神與手法。</p><p>這個姿勢是・・・！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a31daf70d48c37456da01540e856effc19e3fa3ef24f37236a9ab49c27d3d5f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc9462f978fccd29364cb245f86352d99.jpg\"/><p>對戰後也拍了紀念照。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ee82e0ef8e99cd637026ffc61067154c18e2ecf7863412f8824a1f23efa5433e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F14c379703d34b5d3c4847850d070cdd8.jpg\"/><p>拍下使用春麗的使用者春麗。</p><p>以上，就是「AORUS」攤位的報導！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】「LINE GAME」攤位報導！與「表情貼小傢伙（Emoji之子）」面板合影，完成任務挑戰BIG抽獎 🔸【TGS2026】「KIOXIA」攤位報導！「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」全新配色展示等精彩內容 🔸【TGS2026】「《快打旋風6》×SUZUKI」攤位報導！蛛俐風格機車與布蘭卡造型卡車登場 🔸【TGS2026】「PayPal・Paidy」攤位報導！豪華獎品巨大扭蛋機與認識 PayPal 便利性的問答企劃 🔸【TGS2026】電影『快打旋風／真人版電影』特別活動報導！全新日語配音陣容等眾多資訊明朗</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T09:58:36.885613+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":847,"images":10,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}